color Display Background white
axes location Off
display projection Orthographic
display depthcue off
display resize 1200 900
material add Glass
material change ambient    Glass 0.25
material change diffuse    Glass 0.55
material change specular   Glass 0.90
material change shininess  Glass 1.00
material change opacity    Glass 0.32
material change transmode  Glass 1
material change outline    Glass 0.0
material change outlinwidth Glass 0.0
mol new F:/MolecuLens/data/EPI.pdb
mol delrep 0 top
mol representation QuickSurf 1.0 1.5 1.0 1.0
mol color Name
mol selection all
mol material Glass
mol addrep top
mol representation DynamicBonds 1.6 0.30 20
mol color Name
mol selection all
mol material Opaque
mol addrep top
scale by 1.6
render TachyonInternal F:/MolecuLens/docs/figs_v2/vmd/vmd_ref_epi.tga
quit